# SECTION 01 — PURPOSE

## Purpose

The purpose of Phase-08 is to establish the Institutional Capability Ecosystem of the COREI Workbench.

The Capability Ecosystem defines every reusable operational capability available to institutional operators.

Unlike traditional frontend component libraries, this ecosystem is not organised around interface controls.

It is organised around institutional work.

Every capability exists because it enables operators to:

* observe,
* understand,
* investigate,
* analyse,
* decide,
* execute,
* monitor,
* collaborate,
* govern,
* improve.

The Capability Ecosystem therefore becomes the operational vocabulary of COREI.

Every workspace is assembled from capabilities.

Every capability inherits:

* the Constitutional Foundation,
* the Workbench Runtime,
* the Experience Architecture,
* the Institutional Design System,
* the Technology Constitution.

Capabilities remain operationally meaningful regardless of implementation technology.

---

# SECTION 02 — MISSION

## Mission

The mission of the Institutional Capability Ecosystem is to provide a governed collection of reusable operational capabilities that can be composed into any institutional workspace.

Every capability shall satisfy four objectives.

### Operational Value

Every capability shall improve professional work.

Capabilities shall never exist merely to demonstrate technology.

---

### Composability

Capabilities shall compose naturally with other capabilities.

No capability shall assume ownership of an entire workspace.

---

### Reusability

Capabilities shall operate across:

* Trading
* Infrastructure
* Risk
* Research
* Executive
* Compliance
* Future Institutional Domains

A capability is developed once and reused wherever its operational responsibility exists.

---

### Institutional Consistency

Every capability shall communicate, behave and integrate consistently with the COREI Workbench.

Operators shall recognise familiar operational behaviour regardless of workspace.

The Capability Ecosystem therefore becomes the operational toolbox of the institution.

